(5388260, 773264, 96751, '<td valign="top">I''m fascinated by this shot.  The light stream looks like smoke, and that''s very fun and exciting.  I''m impressed that the glass is visible, but it''s not a very strong element, especially since it is almost center.</td>', 'I''m fascinated by this shot.  The light stream looks like smoke, and that''s very fun and exciting.  I''m impressed that the glass is visible, but it''s not a very strong element, especially since it is almost center.', '2009-03-18 01:02:16.000000', NULL, 1),
