(5389148, 773588, 51538, '<td valign="top">Lovely offshore wind on those crests and the birds make this a wonderful photo.  Exposure is perfect too.  (But I don''t think it is a great subject for this challenge).</td>', 'Lovely offshore wind on those crests and the birds make this a wonderful photo.  Exposure is perfect too.  (But I don''t think it is a great subject for this challenge).', '2009-03-18 09:29:18.000000', NULL, 1),
