(5389515, 773826, 101256, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.  I like the idea.  I would have retouched up the base to eliminate it and make the image more spooky, but it''s fine as it is.</td>', 'Nicely done.  I like the idea.  I would have retouched up the base to eliminate it and make the image more spooky, but it''s fine as it is.', '2009-03-18 12:05:49.000000', NULL, 1),
