(5391241, 774161, 7786, '<td valign="top">The best of the bursting matchstick images in this challenge, by far. Well exposed and the blue/red color combination works well.</td>', 'The best of the bursting matchstick images in this challenge, by far. Well exposed and the blue/red color combination works well.', '2009-03-19 05:29:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5391242, 774364, 7786, '<td valign="top">Well exposed image but the combosition is a little off. The left and upper left part of the image is full of interesting things but the lower and right part of the image add nothing of interest. If you kept the vase in the lower right corner and let the light streaks go upwards to the left as you did here you would have had a much strong combosition.</td>', 'Well exposed image but the combosition is a little off. The left and upper left part of the image is full of interesting things but the lower and right part of the image add nothing of interest. If you kept the vase in the lower right corner and let the light streaks go upwards to the left as you did here you would have had a much strong combosition.', '2009-03-19 05:34:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5391281, 774291, 100495, '<td valign="top">Very 1980s. All that''s missing is a pair of glowing lips coming in from the right.<br/> <br/>Nice detail and it looks like you put a lot of effort into the shot.</td>', 'Very 1980s. All that''s missing is a pair of glowing lips coming in from the right. Nice detail and it looks like you put a lot of effort into the shot.', '2009-03-19 07:03:59.000000', NULL, 1),
