(5391297, 774278, 100495, '<td valign="top">Really interesting concept, but the composition seems a little dull.  Maybe a tilt to the left leaving only half the title would have made it more engaging. After all, viewers either know the importance of the title or they don''t, and if they do they would have identified the book from half the title.</td>', 'Really interesting concept, but the composition seems a little dull.  Maybe a tilt to the left leaving only half the title would have made it more engaging. After all, viewers either know the importance of the title or they don''t, and if they do they would have identified the book from half the title.', '2009-03-19 07:18:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5391299, 774258, 100495, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of a power cut I suffered in Scotland once. Nice exposure, but it would have been better without the wall IMO.</td>', 'Reminds me of a power cut I suffered in Scotland once. Nice exposure, but it would have been better without the wall IMO.', '2009-03-19 07:19:30.000000', NULL, 1),
