(5391510, 773985, 37845, '<td valign="top">Creative take on the challenge, and well composed. Im not sure if people will get too literal with the challenge description and DNMC you, as the mask and hand are the subject, but they are not the light source. I think you meet the challenge, and voted you a 9. Hope to see you on the front page.</td>', 'Creative take on the challenge, and well composed. Im not sure if people will get too literal with the challenge description and DNMC you, as the mask and hand are the subject, but they are not the light source. I think you meet the challenge, and voted you a 9. Hope to see you on the front page.', '2009-03-19 10:52:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5391511, 774027, 37845, '<td valign="top">Amazing colours in this abstract. Not sure what it is a picture of, but not sure I want to know either.  Really like this shot. 9</td>', 'Amazing colours in this abstract. Not sure what it is a picture of, but not sure I want to know either.  Really like this shot. 9', '2009-03-19 10:53:43.000000', NULL, 1),
