(5391516, 773432, 100495, '<td valign="top">For me this image isn''t very clear and it''s not obvious what it actually is. The effect is really appealing and it meets the challenge, but there are a million things it could be and I can''t decipher which it is.</td>', 'For me this image isn''t very clear and it''s not obvious what it actually is. The effect is really appealing and it meets the challenge, but there are a million things it could be and I can''t decipher which it is.', '2009-03-19 10:58:04.000000', NULL, 1),
