(5396897, 774274, 35602, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on the challenge.  This seems very noisy and pixelated, though.  Plus I am not discerning an illuminated subject really.  The composition seems well placed, though, and I do like the swordlike grasses.</td>', 'Interesting take on the challenge.  This seems very noisy and pixelated, though.  Plus I am not discerning an illuminated subject really.  The composition seems well placed, though, and I do like the swordlike grasses.', '2009-03-23 16:19:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5396901, 774216, 35602, '<td valign="top">Maybe a little too loosely composed.  Not a single illuminative subject in my mind.  Needs some better focus too.  Try a tripod for slow shutter speeds (on self timer if you don''t have a release cable to prevent camera shake.)  Also need to have a little less exposure to keep the candle from blowing out as this one did.</td>', 'Maybe a little too loosely composed.  Not a single illuminative subject in my mind.  Needs some better focus too.  Try a tripod for slow shutter speeds (on self timer if you don''t have a release cable to prevent camera shake.)  Also need to have a little less exposure to keep the candle from blowing out as this one did.', '2009-03-23 16:21:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5396902, 773926, 35602, '<td valign="top">Nice bokeh, though not sure if it is strong photographically.</td>', 'Nice bokeh, though not sure if it is strong photographically.', '2009-03-23 16:21:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5396906, 774204, 35602, '<td valign="top">Nice color but a bit too splatty for my tastes.  Need a better defined edge on one of the parts of the composition which would make the image feel sharper overall.</td>', 'Nice color but a bit too splatty for my tastes.  Need a better defined edge on one of the parts of the composition which would make the image feel sharper overall.', '2009-03-23 16:23:07.000000', NULL, 1),
