(5399984, 774327, 38162, '<td valign="top">sorry - should have said "border hurts this one" as it takes the eye away from your composition (which I assume was the opposite of your intent.  if borders and titles affect the appreciation of art, then usually the artist can benefit from that kind of feedback.  gl.<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Dirt_Diver:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by oldbimmercoupe:</b></div><hr/><i> border adds nothing </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>You are right the border doesn''t add anything, I hope you didn''t just look at the border and vote on that. If you look a little closer there is a picture in between it. You should try to leave a comment that helps people instead of leaving comments like this. It''s a waste of your time. </i></td></tr></table></td>', 'sorry - should have said "border hurts this one" as it takes the eye away from your composition (which I assume was the opposite of your intent.  if borders and titles affect the appreciation of art, then usually the artist can benefit from that kind of feedback.  gl. Originally posted by Dirt_Diver: Originally posted by oldbimmercoupe: border adds nothing   You are right the border doesn''t add anything, I hope you didn''t just look at the border and vote on that. If you look a little closer there is a picture in between it. You should try to leave a comment that helps people instead of leaving comments like this. It''s a waste of your time. ', '2009-03-25 09:56:59.000000', NULL, 0),
