(5402171, 773587, 103411, '<td valign="top">This was actually one of my favorites.  I think this might have done better in a different challenge.  The colors are really very nice and the tree seems almost other worldly here, I scored one of your 9s.</td>', 'This was actually one of my favorites.  I think this might have done better in a different challenge.  The colors are really very nice and the tree seems almost other worldly here, I scored one of your 9s.', '2009-03-26 14:08:33.000000', NULL, 0),
