(5403149, 774274, 69008, '<td valign="top">I like this shot Lisa, although it didn''t fit within the challenge description, and the voters trashed it, it''s still a cool image.  I am wondering how you got that effect, sort of like posterized. <br/>I think maybe I like it because it reminds me of Cat Island, in the Bahamas. There are a lot of small, abandoned stone buildings among Spanish Sword plants there.</td>', 'I like this shot Lisa, although it didn''t fit within the challenge description, and the voters trashed it, it''s still a cool image.  I am wondering how you got that effect, sort of like posterized. I think maybe I like it because it reminds me of Cat Island, in the Bahamas. There are a lot of small, abandoned stone buildings among Spanish Sword plants there.', '2009-03-26 23:00:08.000000', NULL, 0),
