(5407028, 774235, 7786, '<td valign="top">Thanks everybody for the comments. It came as a suprise that I was first, but thanks too for the great votes guys.</td>', 'Thanks everybody for the comments. It came as a suprise that I was first, but thanks too for the great votes guys.', '2009-03-29 20:42:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(5407256, 774278, 54645, '<td valign="top">Great idea, great book. Definitely interesting, well done. Overall, I think the composition is not quite there. As it is, it''s a bit like a mug shot. With that said, I''m impressed with the concept, and this is also a case of me spouting off about something I don''t do very well...still life composition! ;) <br/></td>', 'Great idea, great book. Definitely interesting, well done. Overall, I think the composition is not quite there. As it is, it''s a bit like a mug shot. With that said, I''m impressed with the concept, and this is also a case of me spouting off about something I don''t do very well...still life composition! ;) ', '2009-03-30 00:04:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(5407262, 773320, 54645, '<td valign="top">So close! I really like the composition, a bit wacky and carefree, as birthday party should be. That foreground candle really should be in focus IMO. I don''t know if you can choose where the camera focuses with a powershot, but it''s just behind the front candle. Also, more DOF would really help capture that front portion of the cake. f/2.6 obviously produced a very tight DOF. The BW was a great choice in my opinion.<br/> <br/>Good luck in your next challenge!</td>', 'So close! I really like the composition, a bit wacky and carefree, as birthday party should be. That foreground candle really should be in focus IMO. I don''t know if you can choose where the camera focuses with a powershot, but it''s just behind the front candle. Also, more DOF would really help capture that front portion of the cake. f/2.6 obviously produced a very tight DOF. The BW was a great choice in my opinion. Good luck in your next challenge!', '2009-03-30 00:10:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(5407696, 773932, 30982, '<td valign="top">My kind of shot.</td>', 'My kind of shot.', '2009-03-30 06:10:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(5408182, 774161, 52115, '<td valign="top">You did it again. And not even with a water drop, it''s more like the opposite of water. Nice sharpness and cloud like smoke.</td>', 'You did it again. And not even with a water drop, it''s more like the opposite of water. Nice sharpness and cloud like smoke.', '2009-03-30 12:00:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(5408397, 774050, 20577, '<td valign="top">This shot would have been better if you would have been drinking it instead of pouring it into a cup. You could have had it dripping down your face as you were chugging it. I realize that it may be toxic and all, but if you really want to challenge yourself as a photographer then you need to push the envelope sometimes.</td>', 'This shot would have been better if you would have been drinking it instead of pouring it into a cup. You could have had it dripping down your face as you were chugging it. I realize that it may be toxic and all, but if you really want to challenge yourself as a photographer then you need to push the envelope sometimes.', '2009-03-30 14:47:37.000000', NULL, 0),
